 "differences": [
  "The paper reports 331 visits; counting distinct (participant, session number) pairs in the metadata gives 335, so that number is not used as a check (how the paper counted visits is not stated).",
  "Table 10 gives a mean stride time of 1.12 s (SD 0.09) for healthy participants; the mean over healthy trials of the mean time between consecutive heel strikes of the same leg in the authors' gait events is 1.154 s, so it is not used as a check (the paper computes it with its own earlier method).",
  "Table 6-8 give age, height, weight and BMI as mean (SD) without saying whether they are per participant or per trial; they are not used as checks.",
  "The deposit's processed files hold empty cells where a sensor had no data at the end of a recording (124425 empty cells in all); they are kept empty.",
  "The deposit's four raw sensor files per trial (acceleration, angular velocity and magnetic field of each sensor before the authors' centring and filtering, about 1.9 GB of text) are not included, to keep the download small."
